  "//archetypes": "archetype = body shape family -> importer bone-name mapping + checker rules. quadruped: leg0..3/hip/named legs; biped: leftLeg/rightLeg (steve) or 2 legs (chicken/creeper leg0/leg1); insect: leg_front/mid/back planes + wing bones; flyer-membrane: leftWing/rightWing+tip, no legs. locomotion: walk=leg cadence checks; fly=wing clip loops, gait checks skip leg-hz. gait: dist-cos=distance-driven cos (default); var:<name>=entity pre_animation variable injection."
